  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Young Expert Programmes</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1) Local and Dutch young professionals. 2) Knowledge institutions, non governmental organisations and private sector parties which deploy a young professional on their international projects. 3) Dutch government and the Dutch business community</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1) Strengthening the international professional network and making it sustainable. After completion of YEP Programmes, Young Experts continue working in the (international) sector. 2) Contribution to the SDGs. Projects within YEP Programmes must cover thematic areas which contribute to the achievement of one or more of the SDGs. 3) Successful deployment of Young Experts. YEP Programmes successfully recruits, selects and matches organisations and young professionals while being sensitive to both gender balance and the ratio of Dutch versus Local Young Experts. 4) Offering high quality training and coaching YEP Programmes offers an intensive training programme for the personal development of the Young Experts, which includes a training at the start of the programme and on return, as well as online master classes. Additionally, Young Experts are assigned a professional YEP coach. 5) An active YEP Global Network Participants of YEP Programmes &#x2013; (alumni) Young Experts and organisations &#x2013; are active in the YEP Global Network and exchange knowledge, experiences and opportunities via various platforms and activities.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">YEP Programmes aims to create a young and inspiring international network, building expertise in the fields of Water, Agrofood and Renewable Energy at Dutch organisations, operating in developing countries and emerging markets, to contribute together to the Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs). Local and Dutch young professionals work together on SDG related projects through YEP Programmes. They are supported with training &amp; coaching. YEP Programmes also offers financial support to organisations hiring Young Experts.</narrative>
  </description>
